            "question": "In a human arm lifting a dumbbell in the hand, where are the Fulcrum (F), Effort (E), and Load (L) located, and which class of lever is the forearm?",
            "questionHinglish": "Jab hum haath mein dumbbell uthate hain, to Fulcrum (F), Effort (E) aur Load (L) kahan hote hain, aur forearm kis class ka lever hai?",
