            "explanationHinglish": "Lamba isliye taaki plug lagate hi sabse pehle suraksha (Earth) jude, aur mota isliye taaki galti se Live chhed mein na ghuse. Metal body mein current leak hone par Earthing use seedha zameen mein bhej kar MCB gira deti hai."
